  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"根据keyword_id或word_id更新搜索词的出价、匹配类型等属性信息，增量更新。不支持更换关键词，如需要，可通过删除接口与创建接口实现。\",\"id\":\"ad.keyword.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/keyword/update/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1768011243105411\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.keyword.create\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要创建关键词后才能更新属性，更换关键词时需要配合使用\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"创建关键词\"},{\"id\":\"ad.keyword.delete\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"更换关键词时需要配合使用\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"删除关键词\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1768011243105411\",\"title\":\"更新关键词属性\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-7hTBM09Z\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rteMS0Co\">根据keyword_id或word_id更新搜索词的出价、匹配类型等属性信息，增量更新。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-puJD16ZZ\">不支持更换关键词，如需要，可通过删除接口与创建接口实现</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201766292135836751%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-PP3lFQ3N\" id=\"h346b9f0-PP3lFQ3N\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-FLQ4FTik\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/keyword/update/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/keyword/update/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1768011243105411\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Hma03lWh\" id=\"h346b9f0-Hma03lWh\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-12cEJZVF\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-QheNCeQ7\" id=\"h346b9f0-QheNCeQ7\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cBo9j6d4\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Zuhe5XF0\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-PETQgGLW\" id=\"h346b9f0-PETQgGLW\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yD193iGJ\">客户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">promotion_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1H4TLWLo\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">待创建搜索关键词的营销ID，仅支持搜索常规投放在单元层级设置关键词</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">project_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RjFKVHbq\">待更新搜索关键词属性的项目ID，仅支持搜索极速智投在项目层级设置关键词</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">keywords</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RH0n5j4D\">关键词列表</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">keyword_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CYQH5hxs\">待更新属性的关键词ID，keyword_id和word_id二者传一个即可，都传则报错。</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">word_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lvXYH9Zl\">待更新属性的词ID，keyword_id和word_id二者传一个即可，都传则报错。</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">match_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yVsRBHEP\"> 匹配类型: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-YjGQc3CP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RlmB1VXE\"><code>EXTENSIVE</code> 广泛匹配</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VbM2El9W\"><code>PHRASE</code> 短语匹配</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iQijLfiH\"><code>PRECISION</code> 精确匹配</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">bid</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gmdN3dhP\">出价，取值范围：0.2至999.0。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PYFffy8z\">当pricing为PRICING_OCPC/PRICING_OCPM时，不支持出价</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-UOxbjmce\">当pricing为PRICING_CPC时，有效且必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_pause</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mFMlNb8Q\">是否停用。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-e4EEXdoL\">允许值：1（停用）、0（启用）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">bid_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-QC46FaGV\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hbMSke67\"><code>CUSTOM</code> 自定义出价</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WaiMKnYd\"><code>WITH_PROMOTION</code> 随营销出价</li></ul> 默认值: <code>CUSTOM</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-hIkZmi3o\" id=\"h346b9f0-hIkZmi3o\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Fkeyword%2Fupdate%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20post(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20POST%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH)%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Content-Type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22application%2Fjson%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.post(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders%2C%20json%3Dargs)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20advertiser_id%20%3D%20ADVERTISER_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20promotion_id%20%3D%20PROMOTION_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20keyword_id%20%3D%20KEYWORD_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20word_id%20%3D%20WORD_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20match_type%20%3D%20MATCH_TYPE%5Cn%20%20%20%20bid%20%3D%20BID%5Cn%20%20%20%20is_pause%20%3D%20IS_PAUSE%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20my_args%20%3D%20%5C%22%7B%5C%5C%5C%22advertiser_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22promotion_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22keywords%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5B%7B%5C%5C%5C%22keyword_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22word_id%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22match_type%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22bid%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C